hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15580","Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Amr, he said: Abidah ibn Sufyan al-Hadrami narrated to me, from Abi al-Jad al-Damri, and he had companionship, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever leaves three Jumuahs in negligence without excuse, Allah the Blessed and Exalted seals upon his heart."
